# Templates Crag maintains in the cports fork (fork delta vs the
# fork point in build/cports-fork-point). Second field:
#   new = not in Chimera's repo -> always built from source
#   mod = exists upstream, we differ -> source-built only when installed
# Regenerate with build/lib/gen-owned-list.sh after every re-pin
# (needs full fork history, not a shallow CI checkout).
acl mod
apk-tools mod
attr mod
base-bootstrap mod
base-cbuild mod
base-cbuild-host mod
base-full mod
base-shells mod
basu new
boost mod
ca-certificates mod
carla mod
catfish mod
chimera-install-scripts mod
chrony mod
cracklib mod
crag-bootstrap-virtual new
cragutils new
curl mod
dhcpcd mod
dinit mod
dinit-chimera mod
dinit-dbus mod
doctest mod
dolphin mod
dracut-install mod
elfutils mod
flatpak-builder mod
glib mod
initramfs-tools mod
iproute2 mod
iwd mod
json-glib mod
less mod
libabigail mod
libcgroup mod
libnftnl mod
libubootenv new
llvm mod
lvm2 mod
man-pages mod
miniserve mod
musl mod
musl-cross mod
musl-mallocng mod
nano mod
ncurses mod
nftables mod
nnn mod
openssh mod
python-nftables mod
rauc new
readline mod
rpi-boot mod
tofi mod
util-linux mod
vim mod
winetricks mod
xinit mod
